         :quotes [{:text "If you're reading this, you must be in dire need of a change."
                  :attrib "Grandpa's letter"}
                 {:text "If you're looking for seeds, my shop is the place to go. I'll also buy produce from you for a good price!"
                  :attrib "Pierre"}
                 {:text "I was born an ordinary boy, but I made a decision early in life that I would become extraordinary."
                  :attrib "Mr. Qi"}
                 {:text "Eric Barone spent four and a half years building the game alone, coding nights after shifts as a movie-theater usher."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "Barone built Stardew alone — except multiplayer, which Chucklefish's Tom Coxon wrote in 2018."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "Barone did the art, the code, and every note of the soundtrack himself, despite having no formal music training."
                  :attrib "development trivia"}
                 {:text "Every farm ends up with one shed nobody remembers the purpose of and forty chests nobody wants to sort."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}
                 {:text "You tell yourself this will be the year you get to bed before 2am in-game. It will not."
                  :attrib "every player, eventually"}]
